    <briefdescription>
<para>Abstract base class for elements that can be validated and accessed in a configuration. </para>
    </briefdescription>
    <detaileddescription>
<para>Elements represent structured or primitive data in a JSON configuration. This class provides an interface for validation, property access, and metadata management such as description and modification status. </para>
    </detaileddescription>
